    owl:versionInfo "1.48.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.48.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.47.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.48.0 (2026-11-26): Chapter 16 deck verify task recorded Done. All 54 notes of deck 4.0.0 were read from the file (68 to 105 words each; slide numbers they name were checked against the deck; the dates and names in the six story notes were read; no presenter direction, no think-of); the automatic checks of 1.41.0 stand."""@en .

ex:TK10_Deck_16_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-26. Notes read note by note from the pptx. One wording left as a judgment call: the note of slide 5 sets a database against a spreadsheet; it is a comparison of two tools, not an everyday analogy, and was left. Not done: the story links were not opened (no network in the shell)." .
